WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
As for the price?

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,760
Our family doesn’t want much

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,320
Thirty to fifty thousand taels will suffice

4
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,610
After all, I have never heard of becoming an official in the future.

5
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,770
Everything needs money

6
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,370
Although our Song family is a merchant,

7
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,370
But also know

8
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,330
It's up to you

9
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:13,730
Not worthy of coming to us

10
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:23,480
This merchant is a female

11
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,520
Forgot to say

12
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:28,200
I have already made a marriage arrangement with Shen Shizi of Pingninghou Mansion.

13
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,270
The sixth day of next month

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,230
I won’t ask you two to manage it.

15
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,940
Pingninghou Mansion

16
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:39,370
In this life, I can't even reach the threshold.

17
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:41,090
Fight the autumn wind between these two

18
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:43,200
Give me a stick to coax me out

19
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,960
The two roast ducks sent last time

20
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,960
Keep it to replenish your health, no need to pay it back
